			"notes": "# First release of Banner Capes\n\n## Features\n* Banner Cape\n  * Can be crafted with a banner to decorate the cape with its patterns, like with a shield\n  * Can be adorned with nubbins of various materials in the crafting table\n    * Currently added are iron and gold nuggets, lapis, and diamonds\n  * Equipable as a trinket in the capes slot\n* Cape rendering more or less equivalent to vanilla capes\n* Some fun advancements.\n  * Well, one fun advancement."
